quadrf-mesh Debian packaging
============================

Building the packages:

  ./scripts/prepare-dependencies.sh
  ./scripts/build-debian.sh

The first script fetches the pinned Meshtastic firmware source, Web UI
assets, and PlatformIO dependencies into vendor/.

The second script packages the source archive and invokes dpkg-buildpackage
to produce quadrf-lora-phy and quadrf-meshtasticd binaries for the target system.
